window.products.push({"id":212197,"name":"Flash Furniture Brighton Queen Size Tufted Upholstered Platform Bed in Black Fabric","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":319.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41or2haGhJL._AC_.jpg","description":"If you're looking for something traditional with modern flair, this cutout panel platform bed will give you what you've been looking for. When your bedroom needs change, start with your bed frame, the headboard with cutout sides is a statement piece all on its own. The panel headboard features gorgeous nail trimming and button tufted upholstery. The low frame will keep the bedroom feeling open. If you don't like making up the bed, this bed is perfect since it is designed without a footboard. The frame features a center support leg and 15 wooden slats that are designed to support your mattress without the use of a box spring. When you're ready for change, this stylish upholstered platform bed will assist. Complete your bedroom makeover with a new pocket spring mattress.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41or2haGhJL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flash Furniture","source_asin":"B0BCVR1D9H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCVR1D9H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCVR1D9H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
