window.products.push({"id":212295,"name":"Final Touch Pro-Measure Dual-Chamber Liquor Bottle Pourer (FTA7051)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gNAv0n6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Measure & pour precise 1oz (30ml) shots quickly and easily straight from the bottle. Dual Chambers The unique dual chamber design automatically measures the next shot while you pour the first. Chamber 1 Tilting the bottle 45˚ fills chamber 1 with 1 oz (30ml) of liquor. Chamber 2 As chamber 1 fills the liquor exits chamber 2 and passes through the spout into the glass. When the bottle is returned upright the liquor from chamber 1 flows into chamber 2 and you’re ready for the next pour.. Measure & pour precise 1oz (30ml) shots quickly and easily Measure & pour precise 1oz (30ml) shots quickly and easily Simply insert into bottle, tilt 45˚ to measure & pour Simply insert into bottle, tilt 45˚ to measure & pour Dual chambers measure the next shot while pouring the first. Just return the bottle upright & you’re ready to pour again! Dual chambers measure the next shot while pouring the first. Just return the bottle upright & you’re ready to pour again! Leak-proof silicone seal fits most bottles Leak-proof silicone seal fits most bottles Works with liquor, liqueur, simple syrup & lemon or lime juice Works with liquor, liqueur, simple syrup & lemon or lime juice","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gNAv0n6ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Final Touch","source_asin":"B01LBM76SY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212295","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LBM76SY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LBM76SY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212296,"name":"P3 International Dr Frog Water Sensor P8220","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-DbKCybNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Is your plant getting the right amount of water? Know for sure with Doctor Frog™. Simply insert the unit into the soil and it will alert you when your plant needs water. This friendly little frog will chirp and croak until your plant gets the water it needs. No more guess work or under watering. Doctor Frog™ constantly evaluates the moisture level of your plant’s soil. Your sleep will never be disturbed. A special light sensor ensures your plant’s watering schedule will be limited to daytime hours because this frog is only active when exposed to light. Doctor Frog™ will help keep your plants happy and healthy. From the Manufacturer Is your plant getting the right amount of water? Know for sure with Doctor Frog. Simply insert the unit into the soil and it will alert you when your plant needs water. This friendly little frog will chirp and croak until your plant gets the water it needs. No more guess work or under watering. Doctor Frog constantly evaluates the moisture level of your plant's soil. Your sleep will never be disturbed. A special light sensor ensures your plant's watering schedule will be limited to daytime hours because this frog is only active when exposed to light. Doctor Frog will help keep your plants happy and healthy.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41-DbKCybNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P3","source_asin":"B004K38U1Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004K38U1Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004K38U1Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212297,"name":"Wicked Edge WE130 - Precision Knife Sharpener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":649.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W1gqiNYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The WE130 is our most versatile sharpener. It offers you the ability to clamp the widest variety of knife grinds, gives you the widest range of angles and the ability to adjust the angles independently. These features create a sharpening system with a highly controlled level of precision for the serious knife enthusiast. The WE130 Precision Sharpener includes our patented Generation 3 Cam-Lock Vise. This vise is ideal for accommodating a wide variety of knife grinds, including fully flat and hollow ground blades. The Split Jaw Design of the vise allows the jaws to flex so they can firmly grasp distally tapered blades, like many everyday-carry pocket knives and kitchen knives. It offers an expansive range of sharpening angles, allowing you to sharpen a wide assortment of blades, from 13 to 35 degrees per side. Blades with wider angles such as cleavers, bushcraft knives, and blades with chisel grinds, are all possible on this sharpener, as well as blades with low angles, like many Japanese knives and many knives made from modern super steels. The WE130 also provides independent angle adjustment, allowing you to sharpen asymmetrical grinds. For avid sharpeners, collectors and knife enthusiasts, the desire to retain the original design or a custom bevel on your knife is paramount to your passion for knives. This sharpener offers coarse angle adjustments in 1 degree increments and micro adjustments of .05 degrees, giving you the flexibility to match the original bevels of your knives without the need to modify the knife’s original grind or unnecessarily remove excess material. The included 10” Guide Rods will allow you to handle knives up to 15 inches in length and the vise has a maximum clamping capacity of 3/16” with an optional attachment (sold separately) for clamping knives with thicknesses up to 1/4\". The WE130 Sharpener can be easily mounted to a home workstation or it can be mounted to any of the bases we offer, with the provided hardware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W1gqiNYoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wicked Edge","source_asin":"B07ZQWSSDF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZQWSSDF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZQWSSDF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
