window.products.push({"id":212323,"name":"Household Essentials Grey Krush Canvas Utility Tote with Pockets | Reusable Grocery Shopping Bag, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+yiPFgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This versatile utility tote is spacious, durable, practical and has a variety of applications. It’s perfect for beach days, camping trips, picnics, tailgating, kids’ sports games, grocery shopping, and hauling laundry or just as an organizer tote in your trunk or home. The bag is made of canvas with a water-resistant vinyl lining. The lining is grafted into the fabric, so it adds durable protection without extra weight or bulk. The water-resistant lining means easy clean up, on the inside or outside of the bag. Prevent moisture from seeping into the bag from wet sand or grass, and keep moisture from condensation or spills inside the bag from leaking out. The lining also helps prevent staining and makes the bag easier to clean. The bag has two long handles attached for easy carrying, and four large exterior pockets with hook-and-loop closures to keep them secure. These pockets are perfect for keeping essential items within easy reach, such as sunscreen or sports drinks, without having to dive into the bag’s large main compartment. The bag’s long rectangular shape is especially well suited for any trunk, making this a great bag to keep with you in your car. Use it to carry essentials, like emergency kit items or tools, or just as an organizer for other car essentials. Fill it up with car or dorm essentials before sending a new grad on their way, or fill it with drinks and snacks for a road trip. The durable lining means you can use the bag to house trash from finished drinks and snacks, too, knowing you’ll have an easy clean up later. When the bag is not in use, it folds flat for easy storage. To clean it, give it a rinse and use the hanging loop attached to the bag to hang it out to dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711+yiPFgpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Household Essentials","source_asin":"B09S8T5ZXT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09S8T5ZXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09S8T5ZXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
