window.products.push({"id":212356,"name":"PAVILIA Soft Compact Travel Blanket and Pillow, Foldable Airplane Blanket in Bag, Lightweight Portable Flight Blanket Set with Luggage Strap, Camping ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lUTs7h77L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"COMPACT TRAVEL BLANKET OR PILLOW: This travel blanket and pillow set, including a throw blanket and a soft bag, is a must-have essential for flying and an ideal gift for international travelers on long flights. This packable blanket is lightweight yet warm, making it ideal for coziness during travel such as airplanes, cars, road trips, camping, beach outings, picnic, business trips, and emergencies. It can be stowed away as a pillow for use at home or office to ensure neck and back support. MUST-HAVE TRAVEL BLANKET: This travel blanket can be easily folded away and transformed into a portable carrying case. The multifunctional carrying bag also serves as a cushioned pillow for head and lumbar support, allowing you to have a restful sleeping on the plane comfortably. It can be effortlessly carried around while traveling or conveniently stored at home without occupying much space. This is an essential accessory during camping, weekend car trip, and traveling on the go. SILKY & SOFT BLANKET: The travel blanket is soft, lightweight, and thin; crafted by high-grade 100% premium microfleece polyester. The edge stitching design enhances durability, making it perfect for any travel adventure. The high-quality material retains heat effectively, ensuring warmth and coziness during long chilly flights. FUNCTIONAL & CONVENIENT TRAVEL CAMPING BLANKET: The compact travel blanket features a luggage sleeve strap and D-ring clip, allowing you to securely attach the blanket to your luggage, suitcase, backpack, or handbag. This small pocket size blanket is seamlessly designed for convenience, eliminating the need for additional carabiners or clips. Its functional design makes this a smart travel accessory and an essential supply for any adventures. MACHINE WASHABLE BLANKET: This airplane blanket is easy to care and maintain. Simply wash in cold water and tumble dry on low. With each wash, this blanket gets even softer, providing increased comfort over time. The blanket measures 65 x 40 inches when unfolded and serves as a portable bag measuring 6 x 9 inches when converted. It can also be used as a wrap, scarf, or lap blanket for men and women at all ages, making it the ideal gift for travelers, adventurers, and outdoor enthusiasts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91lUTs7h77L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAVILIA","source_asin":"B0BZSZ4ZV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZSZ4ZV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZSZ4ZV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
