window.products.push({"id":212389,"name":"Orchard Hardwoods 10\" Rustic Oval Artisan Olive Wood Dough Bowl Bread Basket Boat Shaped - Live bark edge. Natural Server for Fruit, Salads, Chips, Po","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZQS1U45WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ Hand crafted from SINGLE PIECE of solid olive wood sustainably harvested from aged olive trees (typically 200-300 years old) in the Southern Mediterranean. Features exotic burl grains in natural olive wood colors (no stain), oval boat shape, with a live bark edge. Beautifully hand finished with five successively finer grains of sandpaper, then sealed with olive oil. Each item is unique. ALL OF OUR PRODUCTS ARE HANDCRAFTED, RECLAIMED AND SUSTAINABLY PRODUCED UNDER FAIR TRADE AGREEMENT. ✔️ Sizes: Large (10 x 5-6 x 4 in) and Extra large (12 x 6-7 x 4 in). DIMENSIONS ARE +/- 1 in.; SOME PIECES HAVE MORE OR LESS BARK EDGE. BOWLS ARE SUPER RUSTIC WITH NATURAL KNOTS, CRACKS and UNEVEN EDGES CHARACTERISTIC OF ANCIENT OLIVE WOOD ✔️ These bowls are heavy, typically about 0.4 inch thick. Shape, grain, color and natural flaws vary with each piece due to features of the aged olive trees, and because each piece is carved by hand. Photos are examples, not the piece sent. ✔️ Our rare decorative wooden bowls are handmade and one-of-a-kind, and make ideal serveware for salads, fruit, snacks, hors d'oeuvres, bread, condiments, dips, nuts, appetizers, side dishes, charcuterie or any food; as a unique farmhouse décor centerpiece; potpourri or dough bowl, or memorable place to display your keys, jewelry or other personal treasures. Perfect your home or kitchen table presentations with the flair of a professional chef for your friends, family gatherings, or parties. ✔️ Orchard Hardwoods olive wood bowls and boards make unique and personalized gifts for birthday, wedding, anniversary, Christmas, Thanksgiving, housewarming, or an \"I love you\" to your favorite chef, cook, host / hostess or kitchen ninja. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Gently hand wash with soft sponge / warm water, dry gently. Wipe occasionally with olive / mineral oil or food grade beeswax to keep wood from drying. Do not place in dishwasher, soak in water, set in direct sun or near any source of heat. ✔️ Orchard Hardwoods products are sustainably produced and carefully handcrafted under a fair trade agreement, by skilled artisans at a small family owned factory in the developing North African nation of Tunisia. Beautiful old non-bearing olive trees are harvested and reclaimed for their precious hardwood under a government permit, before new trees are replanted in their place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZQS1U45WL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Orchard Hardwoods","source_asin":"B091D45CLZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212389","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091D45CLZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091D45CLZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
