window.products.push({"id":212416,"name":"annadaif Black Duvet Cover Queen (90x90 Inch), 3 Pieces (1 Duvet Cover, 2 Pillowcases) Soft Washed Microfiber Bowknot Bow Tie Duvet Cover Set, Easy Ca","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81axUTyMUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Ultra Soft & Skin friendly] annadaif duvet cover with soft wrinkled fabric for extra warmth, comfy and excellent hand feeling. The whole bowknot duvet cover is used reactive dyes, with solid color design, simple but stylish, both sides can face up. Cute bows add elegance and boho style to any bedroom or guest room. Soft duvet cover set creats a comfortable sleeping environment for good night rest. [100% Microfiber] Our duvet cover sets are made of 100% microfiber polyester fabric and three layers of fiber, which make you sleep soundly all night, even sleeping naked can feel warm and comfortable. Super-micro fiber will softer and more breathable owing to its different fiber structure and large specific surface from conventional fiber. It is not shrink easily. [Unique Bowknot Design] Instead of traditional zipper, our designers designed a more fashionable and beautiful bowknot duvet cover. The bottom of our bow tie duvet cover has an envelope of fabric to hold the comforter. Are you still worried about the comforter getting curled up at night? There are little ties in the corner to hold the comforter in place, without fear of gathering into a ball. [What You Can Get] Available in duvet cover twin: 1 pillowcase (20\"x 26\"), 1 duvet cover set (66\"x 90\"); duvet cover full: 2 pillowcases (20\"x 26\"), 1 duvet cover set (79\"x 90\");duvet cover queen: 2 pillowcases (20\"x 26\"), 1 duvet cover set (90\"x 90\"); duvet cover king: 2 pillowcases (20\"x 36\"), 1 duvet cover set (104\"x 90\"). [Easy Care and Service] Our duvet cover is fit for machine wash in cold, tumble dry with low heat, please do not bleach, light iron as needed, gentle cycle. We have absolute confidence and credit for you to trust!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81axUTyMUfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"annadaif","source_asin":"B07Z238CKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212416","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z238CKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z238CKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
