window.products.push({"id":212509,"name":"Pur UV 36w 110v Light Digital Control Sterilization Living Room Bedroom Sanitizer UV Lamp Help Reduce Allergies to Dust mite Household Pet House Kill ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SoM7l6+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: Power: 36w Votage: 110v  Bulb Service Life: 8000 hours, UV Wave Length: 254nm Instruction: Direct Control：  1.Plug on. The RESET light turns blue. 2.Then press the timing you want: 30 mins, 60 mins, 120 mins. It will start in 60 seconds automatically! Leave the room now!   Remote control:  1.Plug on. The RESET light turns blue.  2.Then press the timing on the remote control: 30 mins, 60 mins, 120 mins outside your door. (3 meters of control distance, can be remote-controlled through the wall and door) [Sterilization Area]: up to 650 SQF effectiveness in a single use. [Sterilization Time]: select the time according to the size of the area, for area up to 300 SQF select a 30 minutes treatment will eliminate 99.99% of the germs, for area larger than 300 SQF select longer time period. [Surface Sterilization]: Put the target within 1-meter distance from the device. 30-minute irradiation is recommended for efficient surface sterilization. [Automatic]: It will automatically turn off after sterilization. After disinfection, you can smell a little odor. It is NOT Ozone. The smell is lower than 0.2mg/m³ , so it is not harmful to human body. It is some kind of taste of decomposition of bacteria such as mites. So no other protection is needed, but if you feel it is strong, we recommend opening the window and door for 5-10 minutes after sterilization. Thanks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SoM7l6+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pur UV","source_asin":"B07FMJNBRN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FMJNBRN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FMJNBRN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
