window.products.push({"id":212519,"name":"Seville Classics Multi Level Shoe Rack Sturdy Freestanding Shelf for Bedroom, Closet, Entryway, Stackable Durable Metal Home Storage, 3-Tier, 12-Pair ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91juXN5iMnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stay organized with Seville Classics' 3-Tier Iron Mesh Utility Shoe Rack. Each tier holds approximately three pairs of shoes. Shelves feature tightly woven iron mesh that supports high-heels, stilettos and up to 30 lbs. of storage per tier. Frame is constructed of iron with a Satin Pewter finish. Snap the shelves into the frame to assemble. Remove shelves and fold away for easy storage. Stack and interlock with multiple units for a personalized storage solution. No tools required. Patents: US Pat. #D602,712 and other US and International Patents Pending Store up to 9 pairs of shoes per unit Store up to 9 pairs of shoes per unit Iron mesh shelves store up to 30 lbs. each Iron mesh shelves store up to 30 lbs. each Satin Pewter finish provides corrosion resistance in dry environments Satin Pewter finish provides corrosion resistance in dry environments 6.2 inches of space between tiers 6.2 inches of space between tiers Stacks only with 3-Tier Iron Mesh Utility Shoe Racks (model #: SHE99905) Stacks only with 3-Tier Iron Mesh Utility Shoe Racks (model #: SHE99905) Does not stack with 2-Tier Iron Mesh Utility Shoe Racks (model #: SHE15896) Does not stack with 2-Tier Iron Mesh Utility Shoe Racks (model #: SHE15896) Interlock multiple units with extra shelves (model #: WEB278) Interlock multiple units with extra shelves (model #: WEB278) Frame folds away for easy storage Frame folds away for easy storage Snap together assembly; no tools required Snap together assembly; no tools required Specifications Dimensions: 26.5\"\" W x 12.2\"\" D x 19.1\"\" H Capacity: 30 lbs. per shelf Weight: 9 lbs. Model #: SHE99905 What’s in the Box? 1 iron rack 4 leveling feet 4 caps 3 shelves 4 connection pins Limited 1-Year Manufacturer. /strong>","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91juXN5iMnS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Seville Classics","source_asin":"B0BJ1YKY3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212519","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ1YKY3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ1YKY3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212520,"name":"Deny Designs Clara Nilles Glowing Owl On Sunset Shower Curtain, 69\" x 72\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DOVXyZ4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Who says bathrooms can't be fun? To get the most bang for your buck, start with an artistic, inventive shower curtain. This woven polyester shower curtain features a vibrant printed front and white back and includes 12 buttonhole openings at the top (rings not included). While water resistant, we recommend using a clear shower curtain liners for best results (liner not included). Based in Denver, Colorado, Deny Designs is a modern, think-outside-the-box home furnishings company. Deny empowers its customers to transform dull, everyday household accessories into fun and original statement. With each purchase, our team of talented artists earn part of the proceeds, enabling Deny to support art communities all over the world while also spreading the creative love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DOVXyZ4lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B01N286GAM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212520","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N286GAM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N286GAM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212521,"name":"LHR trading inc Feng Shui Dragon Turtle Wealth Protection Statue Figurine (Red)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817zEtqjiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dragon Turtle ~ Legendary Chinese creature, dragon head with turtle body. It symbolizes courage, determination, fertility, longevity, power, success, and support. Dragon ~ the most powerful symbol in Feng Shui. He symbolizes power, majestic, strength and good luck! Baby turtle ~ It brings energy of stability, longevity, protection, and descendants' luck (many children)!! Money base ~ It represents abundant wealth and prosperity. Where to place? Office ~ Behind your seat. This indicates you have support and protection from both of dragon and turtle. North or Northwest areas of your home or office for career advancement. Apart from that, you may use it as paperweight in office :) Home ~ North or East. It brings good luck, wealth, and feeling of security to the family. *Do not put the statue in the North or East if it is directly in front of you while putting it at office. Instead, just locate it parallel to where you sit or right behind the seat. Great gift or decorative statue to put in office and home for good Feng Shui!! Nice packaging~ a presentable red box with good protection. Great collection for Feng Shui LOVERS!!! *****NOTE: Product color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817zEtqjiTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LHR trading inc","source_asin":"B07Y6V3CT6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212521","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y6V3CT6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y6V3CT6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212522,"name":"Kate and Laurel Sylvie Gold, Yellow, Orange Pink Geometric Design Abstract Art Print, Square Framed Canvas Wall Art by Grant Mahr, 24x24 Gold","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11FUXZ9ehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Lush color is brought to life in this vibrant digital abstract art print featuring the bright golds, oranges, yellows, purples, and pinks. The modern pattern of loops with bold splashes of color create a fantastic contemporary look. The pastels jump out in an exciting display of brush strokes forming an intriguing design that draws you in. Printed and framed in the USA in Waunakee, Wisconsin, this framed floating canvas art will be a pleasure to look at every day in your living room, bedroom, nursery, or any room in the home. Printed on gallery wrapped canvas and framed with a gold lightweight polystyrene frame, this colorful wall art has two hangers already attached to the natural wood colored MDF back for easy wall display. The outer dimensions are 24 inches tall by 24 inches wide by 1.6 inches deep. Artist Biography: Grant Mahr, From Wisconsin. A graduate of Milwaukee Institute of Art & Design with a degree in Communication Design, Grant enjoys pushing the boundaries in his work while holding onto basic design principles. The original glass pieces he paints involves a backwards technique. This process gives him the control he needs to be able to manipulate the paint. Adding water or chemicals, the colors flow together allowing them to take their own path. Once the paint is down, the rest is up to nature's reactions, creating a chaotic stream of color.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A11FUXZ9ehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kate and Laurel","source_asin":"B07JWHCLR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212522","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JWHCLR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JWHCLR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
