window.products.push({"id":212575,"name":"THE WHITE HOUSE cooking style Wooden Rotating Kitchen Board. Turntable Rotating Cake Stand, Pizza Board, Cheese Board, Party Serving Board (11-1/2\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MW4RniNnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The White House Cooking Style Combines the Past with the Present to Turn the Tides There's a new lazy susan in town and she's quickly gaining a reputation among home entertainers! Whether you frequently throw dinner parties for your friends or cocktail parties for your confidants, every single smart host or hostess knows he or she needs a rotating board to depend on when serving. And this particular rotating display stand by TWHCS does just the trick … in truly elegant fashion. Here are just some ideas of ways to use your new round board to help out around around the kitchen: ♦ Serving Cakes, Cupcakes & Pies This really is the best rotating cake stand! Use it as a baby shower cake stand, a cake stand for weddingswith a rustic or earthy feel or as a decorative cake stand and cupcake stand for parties, bake sales and so on. ♦ Serving Cheeses, Veggies & Meats Since it it made out of natural eco-friendly wood, our 10 , 11-1/2 , 13-1/2, 17-1/2 inch turntable lazy susan is safe enough to displaymeats, veggie sticks with cups of dip, fruit bits and cheese blocks without the need for foil or parchment paper. ♦ Serving Pizzas, Roll Ups & Snacks This wood lazy susan by far makes an excellent rotating stand to use when serving pizza,roll up munchies for the kids or snacks such as energy bites, croissants, s'mores and the list goes on! ♦ Other Suggested Serving Board Uses Use the heavy duty lazy susan as a pantry lazy susan to keep cans, containers or small boxes organized, use itto display your spice jars or use it to hold salad bowls, casserole dishes, etc. when serving a dinner spread. This revolving stand outperforms, outshines and outlasts other turntable boards. And it's selling fast. CARE: Wash the woodwork using only organic detergents, wipe it with a dry towel. Occasionally oil with food olive.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MW4RniNnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EFO","source_asin":"B072HH7NC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072HH7NC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072HH7NC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
