window.products.push({"id":212624,"name":"CORRURE 'I'm 21 Bitches' Glitter Birthday Sash and Headband - Rose Gold Glitter and Tiara Headband for You To Stand Out and Look Stunning - Ideal 21st","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912fq7nuufL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️ QUEEN OF THE PARTY -- This elegant birthday sash set will make you stand out and turn heads wherever you are. Dress up and enjoy being the center of attention on your special day. ✅ WHAT YOU GET -- 1 premium quality glitter sash and 1 matching ROSE GOLD TIARA HEADBAND. Uniquely designed with \"I'm 21 Bitches\" message. Feel beautiful and confident knowing no other girl in the room will have your kind of sash. Wear it with flair whatever your style is. 100% Instagram-friendly! ✅ FITS PERFECTLY -- Sash dimension: 33.5 x 3.7 inches. Headband: 4.7 inches (width). Adjustable and will fit most women or men. The soft and smooth satin material makes it extremely comfortable to wear even for a long time. The tiara is secure, adjustable, and will fit most head sizes. Ready to wear and looks good on any outfit or hairstyle! ✅ STUNNING HEADPIECE -- The birthday girl deserves to get the most attention. This headband is a perfect accesory for any dress and it can be used for another occasion. Wear it with flair and make your day extra special. ✅ PARTY ALL DAY AND NIGHT -- Elegant, stylish, and made of high-quality materials. Unlike other regular sashes and crowns, our birthday sash set won't break, tear, or wrinkle easily. No need to worry about letters or flowers peeling off. It can withstand all the fun craziness you and your friends are up to. Durable and reusable for the following years. ✅ AWESOME CELEBRATION, PERFECT GIFT -- Enjoy a memorable birthday with this trendy sash set. You can upgrade your Sweet 16 Party, 18th Birthday Party, 21st Celebration, Dirty 30th Birthday or any other birthday parties. Also makes a thoughtful present for a beloved family or friend. ✅ Don't let CORONAVIRUS STOP YOU -- It's a hard time for everybody, but now more than ever is the time to enjoy the little things in life. STAY HOME but get your friends together on a video call and feel extra special with this beautiful sash set. Having a great birthday is still possible. All you need is a fun attitude!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/912fq7nuufL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORRURE","source_asin":"B08B3Y4HGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3Y4HGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3Y4HGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
