window.products.push({"id":212701,"name":"Kmise Spring Wreath Fall Decor Wreath for Front Door-23 Inch Summer Peony Eucalyptus Wreaths for Front Porch Farmhouse Home Decor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vy0011TZL._AC_.jpg","description":"Professional florists use more than a dozen kinds of artificial flowers such as daisies, peony, roses, lavender, eucalyptus leaves, sunflowers to customize this wreaths, with unique color matching, suitable for the four seasons of spring, summer, fall and winter This summer fall wreaths can be used indoors or outdoors, placed on your front door, fireplace, wall as home decor,farmhouse wreath, etc.; it is also suitable for Thanksgiving, Halloween and other holiday decorations, the bright colors add a pleasant and romantic atmosphere to the space Lavender represents happiness, sunflower represents sunshine and health, the flower language of eucalyptus is the gift of nature, peony means missing. In ancient China, men and women communicated with each other and gave each other peony to express a bond of love or farewell. This wreath contains all the good wishes,will amaze every friend and neighbor who comes to your home Large and plump white peony flowers, yellow roses, sunflowers, and various green leaves make this wreath full and lush, perfect for spring, summer, autumn and winter as well as matching doors in various colors The garland is made of high quality materials, durable and reusable, the persian grass eucalyptus leaves never rot and the flowers never fall The outer diameter of the garland is about 23-25 inches, and the package is about 14 inches. The wreath may be squeezed by the box, please blow it with a hair dryer to unfold it fully before hanging","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vy0011TZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kmise","source_asin":"B0BGP8SGVG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212701","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGP8SGVG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGP8SGVG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":212702,"name":"Blue Replacement Lid with Slider Closure for Yeti Rambler, Ozark Trail Tumblers - Works Perfect with Straws (Tumbler not included)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811jE-9IGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you're anything like most people, you can't live without your favorite beverages, whether it's the life-sustaining cup of coffee that you drag to work with you every morning, the endless gulps of water and electrolyte-fortified sports drinks that keep you going through a long afternoon at the gym or a tough practice session with the company softball team, or the iced tea that you sip while you're unwinding at home and watching the sun go down. You don't need any help to enjoy your drink as it warms you up, cools you down, or gives you the energy you need to tackle a full day of work and play, but like everything else in your life, savoring the moments that you spend sipping your beverages of choice can seem a little trickier once you think about all the errands you run, miles you drive, and tiny annoyances that you have to shrug off during all your waking hours. After all, how much caffeine can you get from coffee or tea that spills all over your lap or splashes the fabric on your passenger seat whenever your car has to make a sudden stop? How are you supposed to cool off with a glass of lemonade or a freshly opened bottle of soda if it's already disgustingly lukewarm by the time you have the chance to take your first gulp? Why is it so hard to stay hydrated when you're dodging potholes with your car or truck, bobbing along on the waves of a nearby lake during your latest vacation, or bumping across the city on the last train home? With the way it's designed, it'll be easy enough for you to slide one of these lids open whenever you want to take a drink or take it off entirely when you need a refill, but difficult for the contents of your cup to spill under any other conditions, which gives you a chance to enjoy all of life's most refreshing, thirst quenching comforts even when you're on the go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811jE-9IGBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Polar Mugs","source_asin":"B01HGYPXZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HGYPXZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HGYPXZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
