window.products.push({"id":212748,"name":"Portable Air Purifier,Timeage Personal Air Purifier Necklace, Portable Mini Air Ionizer Eliminates Pollen,Smoke,Dust for Outdoor,Travel(Touch Panel)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":43.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61beGG5XRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Work principle:Timeage personal air purifier adopts ionizer technology,the ions is a negatively charged atom, molecule or complex molecule having more than its normal amount of electrons. You cannot see this tiny object with the naked eye nor feel it, how to tell if it works? You can hear a mechanical noise from ionizer generator if ear near to the purifier,after month you will feel the brush greasy, like a magnet, some bad substance left on the brush,not go to the breathing system. Protect personal space:The ions produced by the wearable air purifier form an invisible protective cover that can effectively resist air pollutants such as PM2.5,pollen,dust,and second-hand smoke.Create a healthy private space for you. Easy to use:Touch on/off. Keep high gear for working. When power indicator is in red, please charge it. After fully charged, it will be white.When charging, do not power on the mini air purifier. Fashionable and convenient:This small air purifier can be used as neck accessories,also be used as home and car accessories.It is very fashionable,and can be used in cars,offices,subways,planes and other complicated environments,let the fresh air always be with you. Best choice:Personal air purifier is very suitable for children,students,the elderly and other people with low body resistance.It can also relieve yourself,etc.You can better care for your family.Patent No.:29804457","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61beGG5XRyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Timeage","source_asin":"B0C52ZSBV3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212748","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C52ZSBV3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C52ZSBV3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
