window.products.push({"id":212979,"name":"BEDDING BANDZ Bed Sheets Organizer. A Clever Color-Coded System to Organize and Identify Sheet Sets by Size (Pack of 2) (Reversible Twin/Full 26.5\" W ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515tbJ7hSmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Bedding Bandz The Original Bed Sheets Organizer. A clever, color-coded system to organize and identify sheet sets by size. Bedding Bandz is the PERFECT solution for organizing and storing your bed linens! No bulky storage boxes needed. Free up valuable closet space and eliminate closet clutter permanently! Imagine going to your closet and finding the exact size sheets you need in a perfectly organized bundle! Bedding Bandz feature durable inch-and-a-half elastic for versatile form-fitting to any thickness of sheets. These patented reversible devices are color-coded AND printed by size, so you never have to unfold the wrong size sheets again. Perfect for Home, Vacation Homes, Summer Camps, College Dorms, Bed & Breakfast and more! Great Gifts for Weddings, Housewarmings and Travel! Available in 2 sizes: Reversible TWIN/FULL (pack of 2) Reversible QUEEN/KING (pack of 2) U.S. Patents 8,439,199 & 8,936,155.Function of Bedding Bandz Each unit of Bedding Bandz is reversible and features: double-sided center piece with size indicated (different on each surface); 2 elastic straps with Velcro-type fasteners on the ends. (Each strap is also printed with the same size & color as the center piece for the intended size of sheets) Watch our video! The product is sold in packs of 2 identical units. One pack is intended to serve 2 sets of sheets. The reversible nature of the product gives you greater flexibility because each product can be used for two different sizes of sheet set. Example # 1: a pack of (2) TWIN/FULL Bedding Bandz gives you the ability to organize: Either 2 TWIN sets; or 2 FULL sets; or1 TWIN and 1 FULL set, depending on your needs.  Dimensions: 26 1/2” wide x 31 ½” long. Example # 2: a pack of (2) QUEEN/KING Bedding Bandz will give you the ability to organize:Either 2 QUEEN sets; or 2 KING sets; or 1 QUEEN and 1 KING set, depending on your needs.Dimensions: 29” wide x 33” long.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/515tbJ7hSmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDDING BANDZ","source_asin":"B093C9WYPB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-212979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C9WYPB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C9WYPB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
